    His practice is grounded in making, in the encounter with materials and in an attention to contemporary symbols.

    1000€
    `
  },
  {
    name: "Chair I, 2025",
    images: ["/images/chair_I_2025.png"],
    description: `
    Hafner, Gabriel (1995 - ), Chair I, 2025, Wood and steel, 50 x 37 x 70 cm.

    Furniture and objects developed for Galerie Ida’s Room in Paris. The chairs follow a design approach inspired by adhocism, as described by Charles Jencks. 
